cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Intro to Programming, Part 2: Data and Security with Python'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications or adapt it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Australian Data and Cyber Institute (ADCI)
abstract: >-
  A six-week, beginner Python micro-credential (6 hours per week
  or less), the second of two parts. It covers text, files and logs,
  checking data and files, and NumPy, Pandas and Matplotlib for data
  science and cyber security, with weekly Concepts Bridges and
  practice tasks that use synthetic data.
keywords:
  - Python
  - data science
  - cyber security
  - NumPy
  - Pandas
  - Matplotlib
  - micro-credential
